<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<!--
  RUT_DeltaLoam.xml                      UtinniPatches - COMMISSION_LEDGER_CLEANUP_1

  Resolves half of ledger slug
  `the_miasma:delta-loam-composter-castings-producer`
  (design/Jawa/worldbuilding/biomes/the_miasma.md §7: "Delta loam - the
  composters' castings: clean, fertile, exportable soil"; miasma_fauna_
  roster_2026-09-23.md row 2, RM_Karrobel: "The delta loam is its castings.
  The sheet's §7 export and the hopeful mirror of the Scarlands' mortuary
  guild").

  Plain resource good, no comps of its own — same shape as RUT_TibannaGas.xml
  (FORGE_MECHANICS_1 F2): the gathering comp lives on the ANIMAL
  (RUT_Karrobel.xml, this same pass), not the item.

  MarketValue is a placeholder export-good figure (clean fertile soil, a
  genuine commodity per the sheet's §7, but not priced against anything —
  no other soil/fertilizer resource exists in this mod set to benchmark
  against). thingCategories ResourcesRaw, matching the sheet's framing as a
  raw export rather than a manufactured good.

  🔴 Deliberately NOT wired to RM_Pallasheen's "germinates only on delta
  loam" mechanism (miasma_fauna_roster_2026-09-23.md row 18) — that plant is
  its own roster row from a DIFFERENT slug set (the flora roster, not this
  ledger's the_miasma group) and is not owed by this item; this def ships
  only what the ledger slug itself asks for (a castings producer + the
  castings good it produces).

  Texture: own new texPath, art job filed this pass (checked
  infrastructure/artpipe/{done,pending,registry.jsonl} for "loam"/"castings"
  first — clean). No DEPLOY_HOLD.txt entry, matching the RUT_FleetFlier/
  RUT_DarkCrust precedent for a pending own-namespace texPath.
-->
<Defs>

  <ThingDef ParentName="ResourceBase">
    <defName>RUT_DeltaLoam</defName>
    <label>delta loam</label>
    <description>Clean, fertile soil worked loose and cast up by karrobel burrowing through the Miasma's muck. Where the karrobel have been, the ground turns rich and dark — the one export from this biome that arrives already refined.</description>
    <graphicData>
      <texPath>Things/Item/Resource/RUT_DeltaLoam</texPath>
      <graphicClass>Graphic_StackCount</graphicClass>
    </graphicData>
    <statBases>
      <MarketValue>3.5</MarketValue>
      <MaxHitPoints>50</MaxHitPoints>
      <Mass>0.6</Mass>
      <Flammability>0</Flammability>
      <DeteriorationRate>1.0</DeteriorationRate>
    </statBases>
    <stackLimit>75</stackLimit>
    <thingCategories>
      <li>ResourcesRaw</li>
    </thingCategories>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
